Subject: [PATCH 1044/3799] soh: rename func_808AC4A4 -> BgSpot01Objects2_Draw

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: the actor's draw function, installed into actor.draw once the object is loaded; it draws sDLists indexed by params.
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Spot01_Objects2/z_bg_spot01_objects2.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
